  "body": "Tender: Closes on Monday 7 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA rare offering for those who seek exceptional space, quality and sophistication. Step into a world where architectural excellence meets refined family living. Set on an impressive 2,500m² of private, beautifully landscaped grounds and offering approximately 489m² of substantial floor space, this extraordinary residence delivers an exceptional combination of luxury, comfort, privacy and versatility.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, there is a wonderful sense of escape. Beautifully established gardens create a peaceful and picturesque setting, with mature palms, manicured lawns, carefully shaped hedging and elegant classical features. Peace and tranquillity are part of everyday life here, accompanied by birdsong, sunshine and beautiful garden views. The fully fenced and gated grounds create a private sanctuary for the whole family. Children and pets can enjoy the expansive play areas, while the deck and dedicated picnic area provide an inviting setting for relaxed outdoor entertaining, family gatherings and memorable moments. A three-car garage plus dedicated storage adds further practicality to this impressive estate.\r\n\r\nInside, the quality is unmistakable. Offering three spacious living areas plus a dedicated office, the home provides exceptional flexibility for family life, entertaining and working from home. At the heart of the residence, the designer kitchen combines style and functionality, complemented by a secondary kitchen, butler’s pantry and servery — ideal for effortless everyday living as well as hosting larger gatherings. Designed with generational living in mind, the home features an exceptional five master bedrooms, each with its own ensuite, providing an outstanding level of privacy, comfort and convenience for family members and guests alike.\r\n\r\nThe location further enhances the lifestyle. Westfield Albany and the Beach are both within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shopping, dining, recreation and entertainment. With convenient motorway access and public transport connections nearby, commuting is effortless. Families will also appreciate the proximity to Kristin School, Pinehurst School, Massey University and other highly regarded educational facilities.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property offers a rare balance of space, privacy, luxury and convenience. Homes of this scale and versatility are seldom available. More than simply a magnificent residence, this is a home designed for generations to come together, for everyday living to feel elevated, and for treasured memories to be created.",
